Package: CalcDuplexMetrics
Title: Calculate Duplex Metrics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("WEHI Genomics R&D", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "genomics@wehi.edu.au")
Description: CLI tool for calculating duplex sequencing QC metrics
    (efficiency, drop-out rate, family statistics, GC bias) from
    summarised read-bundle information files (.rinfo).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/WEHIGenomicsRnD/calculate-duplex-metrics
BugReports: https://github.com/WEHIGenomicsRnD/calculate-duplex-metrics/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    argparse,
    data.table,
    magrittr,
    seqinr,
    Rsamtools,
    Biostrings,
    GenomeInfoDb,
    GenomicRanges,
    IRanges,
    parallel
Suggests:
    devtools,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
